        "Subcategory": "Server:dns:1",
        "Description": "Address players use to reach this server: your public IP or a domain (e.g. mh.example.com). Players launch the client with -robocopy -nosteam -siteconfigurl=ADDRESS/SiteConfig.xml (ADDRESS = this setting). A new account database includes test accounts test1@test.com to test5@test.com with password 123: ban them (!account ban test1@test.com) or enable the whitelist before opening the server to the public",
